  {
    "id": 2014006040010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "わぁ～、見てみてプロデューサーさん！\r\nこのクリオネかわいー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_joy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040140020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201400604/2014006040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "随分小さいんだな、透明で綺麗だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006040020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ね～！　あ、こっちのもかわいー！\r\nえへへ、見てて飽きないな～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400604/2014006040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この水槽、気に入ったみたいだな\r\nここもＰＶで使う候補にしようか",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006040030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そうだね☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400604/2014006040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006040040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でも、今度のＰＶ、甘奈の好きな場所で\r\n撮影していいなんて、めっちゃテンション上がっちゃうな",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400604/2014006040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今回はそういう依頼だからな\r\n色々と見て、ファンに喜んでもらえるＰＶにしよう",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006040050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん！　プロデューサーさんも\r\nなんか思いついたらどんどん言ってね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400604/2014006040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006040060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ふたりで力を合わせて\r\n超素敵なの、作りたいから☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400604/2014006040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんだ、俺もどんどんいいところ\r\n見つけてくぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006040070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "よーし！　プロデューサーさん\r\n今度はあっちの方も見てみよ！　イルカとかいるみたい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400604/2014006040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、行ってみよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
