    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400604/2014006040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、決まりだな\r\n甘奈、休日に来てもらって悪かった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "目的は達成したから、帰っても大丈夫だぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006040150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、気を遣ってくれたんだよね、ありがと",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400604/2014006040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006040160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でもね……まだちょっと……ここにいたいな……\r\nだめ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_trouble",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
